<title>USA: Atlantic Beverage adds premium brands.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Beverage adds premium brands.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Beverage Co Inc said on Wednesday its Maryland-based beverage unit added the Clearly Canadian and Orbitz brands to its line of premium specialty beverage products.</p>
<p>Under a recent agreement, the company was appointed exclusive distributor of these brands for the Baltimore and Washington, D.C. metropolitan areas.</p>
<p>The Clearly Canadian and Orbitz brands are owned by Clearly Canadian Beverage Corp.</p>
<p>Atlantic Beverage  manufactures and distributes food products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
